# pytest's cache, which git never sees and Prettier does.
#
# pytest writes a .gitignore inside its own cache directory, so `git status` stays clean while
# `format:check` — which walks the filesystem — finds .pytest_cache/README.md and fails the gate.
# This repository has Python under tools/ambience/, so anyone who runs those tests hits it.
.pytest_cache/

